ComfyUI Remote Panel
====================

The bundled MiniMax H3 workflow presets are derived from the official ComfyUI
workflow templates and a locally tested parameter variant. The official
templates are distributed under the MIT License:

https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates

The presets do not include model weights, LoRAs, user media, ComfyUI history,
or generated output. Model names and download URLs are descriptive dependency
metadata only. ComfyUI and model weights retain their respective licenses.

The optional H3 companion node and visual-workflow distribution is described in
h3-workflows/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Its dependency licenses are retained, and
official prompt resources are downloaded separately rather than redistributed.
